@startuml
!theme plain
title Context Diagram - Cardiopulmonary Sound Separation Prototype

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #2F4858
  BackgroundColor #F8FBFC
}

actor "Student / Researcher\nUser" as User
database "Public Audio Datasets\n(for development and evaluation)" as Dataset
folder "Local Model Files\nand Runtime Storage" as Storage
rectangle "Machine Learning-Based\nCardiopulmonary Sound\nSeparation Prototype" as System

User --> System : Upload mixed WAV\nand select model
System --> User : Validation feedback\nand processing status
System --> User : Separated heart\nand lung outputs
Dataset --> System : Training, baseline,\nand evaluation data
System --> Storage : Read model files\nand save outputs
Storage --> System : Model metadata,\nuploads, results

note bottom of System
Prototype scope: heart-lung sound separation only.
No disease diagnosis or treatment decision is provided.
end note

@enduml
